Dialogue: 6,0:05:33.06,0:05:38.15,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}いつかあのドームいっぱいの愛で君を染めるわ
Dialogue: 6,0:05:45.37,0:05:51.16,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}私たちは星の子　輝くために　生まれてきたのさ
Dialogue: 6,0:05:51.16,0:05:56.38,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}君が望んでくれた　一番光る　最推しになりたい
Dialogue: 6,0:05:56.38,0:06:02.18,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}交差してゆくスポットライト　本番はこれから
Dialogue: 6,0:06:02.18,0:06:05.93,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}見せて君のロマンス　UOもグルグルグル
Dialogue: 6,0:06:05.93,0:06:08.60,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}地下から始まる逆襲劇
Dialogue: 6,0:06:09.06,0:06:12.03,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}今に見てなさい　あの手この手　make it
Dialogue: 6,0:06:12.03,0:06:15.00,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}もう戻れない　この道を進むしかない
Dialogue: 6,0:06:15.00,0:06:18.27,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}尻尾掴んだチャンス　絶対に逃さない
Dialogue: 6,0:06:18.93,0:06:25.66,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}あなたのアイドルでずっといるために　いつか
Dialogue: 6,0:06:25.66,0:06:32.00,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}いつかあのドームいっぱいのサイリウムで君を染めてあげるわ
Dialogue: 6,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.67,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}後方腕組み彼氏ヅラしても
Dialogue: 6,0:06:34.67,0:06:37.13,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}ちゃんと泣かせちゃうから
Dialogue: 6,0:06:37.13,0:06:40.09,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}まだ足りない！ ひときわきらめく一等星
Dialogue: 6,0:06:40.09,0:06:43.26,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}満たされない！ このままじゃ優等生
Dialogue: 6,0:06:43.26,0:06:46.39,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}届くわけない？ 揃いも揃って　what you gonna say
Dialogue: 6,0:06:46.39,0:06:51.35,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}もう夢じゃない　夢じゃないリベンジ
Dialogue: 6,0:06:52.27,0:06:56.03,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}もう夢じゃない　あの日のリベンジ
Dialogue: 7,0:05:33.06,0:05:38.15,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}终有一天  要用满载「巨蛋」的爱意将你浸染
Dialogue: 7,0:05:45.37,0:05:51.16,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我们是星辰之子  生来就是为了绽放光芒
Dialogue: 7,0:05:51.16,0:05:56.38,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}想成为最耀眼的推  不负你所望
Dialogue: 7,0:05:56.38,0:06:02.18,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}聚光灯交错变换  高潮即将上演
Dialogue: 7,0:06:02.18,0:06:05.93,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}荧光棒不停地转  展现你的浪漫
Dialogue: 7,0:06:05.93,0:06:08.60,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}自地下开始的逆袭剧
Dialogue: 7,0:06:09.06,0:06:12.03,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}等着瞧吧  使出浑身解数  将它实现
Dialogue: 7,0:06:12.03,0:06:15.00,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}回不去了  唯有沿着此路向前
Dialogue: 7,0:06:15.00,0:06:18.27,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}抓住关键机会  绝不松手
Dialogue: 7,0:06:18.93,0:06:25.66,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}为了能永远做你的偶像  终有一天
Dialogue: 7,0:06:25.66,0:06:32.00,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}终有一天  要用照亮「巨蛋」的应援海将你浸染
Dialogue: 7,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.67,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}就算你在后方交叉双臂装作男友摸样
Dialogue: 7,0:06:34.67,0:06:37.13,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我也定会让你感动落泪
Dialogue: 7,0:06:37.13,0:06:40.09,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}还远远不够！ 要做那颗最夺目的星星
Dialogue: 7,0:06:40.09,0:06:43.26,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}还没有满足！ 这样下去我只是优等生
Dialogue: 7,0:06:43.26,0:06:46.39,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}不可能实现？ 一个个的到底在说什么
Dialogue: 7,0:06:46.39,0:06:51.35,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}这已不是梦  绝非幻梦的复仇
Dialogue: 7,0:06:52.27,0:06:56.03,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}这已不是梦  是那一日的复仇
Dialogue: 6,0:15:17.13,0:15:19.71,Insert - 2 - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I'm on your side
Dialogue: 6,0:15:24.82,0:15:27.19,Insert - 2 - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I'm on your side
Dialogue: 6,0:15:37.70,0:15:41.01,Insert - 2 - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I swear
Dialogue: 6,0:15:46.67,0:15:49.83,Insert - 2 - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I'm on your side
Dialogue: 6,0:15:54.14,0:15:56.60,Insert - 2 - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I'm on your side
Dialogue: 6,0:16:00.19,0:16:05.82,Insert - 2 - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I feel your love for me
Dialogue: 6,0:16:07.24,0:16:13.70,Insert - 2 - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I'm aware of mine
Dialogue: 6,0:16:16.76,0:16:23.55,Insert - 2 - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}But this may be the best choice for both of us
Dialogue: 6,0:16:25.38,0:16:29.68,Insert - 2 - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}Don't look at me that way
Dialogue: 6,0:16:31.01,0:16:34.99,Insert - 2 - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I just don't want to keep hurting you
Dialogue: 6,0:16:40.45,0:16:44.19,Insert - 2 - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}A little sadness
Dialogue: 6,0:16:45.99,0:16:49.91,Insert - 2 - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}Will save you from a great sadness
Dialogue: 6,0:16:49.91,0:16:54.79,Insert - 2 - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}So I will go
Dialogue: 6,0:16:54.79,0:17:02.05,Insert - 2 - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}I've made up my mind for us
Dialogue: 7,0:15:17.13,0:15:19.71,Insert - 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我与你同在
Dialogue: 7,0:15:24.82,0:15:27.19,Insert - 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我与你同在
Dialogue: 7,0:15:37.70,0:15:41.01,Insert - 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我许下誓言
Dialogue: 7,0:15:46.67,0:15:49.83,Insert - 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我与你同在
Dialogue: 7,0:15:54.14,0:15:56.60,Insert - 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我与你同在
Dialogue: 7,0:16:00.19,0:16:05.82,Insert - 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我能感受到你的爱
Dialogue: 7,0:16:07.24,0:16:13.70,Insert - 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}也明白自己的眷恋
Dialogue: 7,0:16:16.76,0:16:23.55,Insert - 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}但这或许是彼此最好的选择
Dialogue: 7,0:16:25.38,0:16:29.68,Insert - 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}别那样看着我
Dialogue: 7,0:16:31.01,0:16:34.99,Insert - 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我只是不想你再受到伤害
Dialogue: 7,0:16:40.45,0:16:44.19,Insert - 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}一点点的悲哀
Dialogue: 7,0:16:45.99,0:16:49.91,Insert - 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}会救你于巨大的苦海
Dialogue: 7,0:16:49.91,0:16:54.79,Insert - 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}所以我会离开
Dialogue: 7,0:16:54.79,0:17:02.05,Insert - 2 - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}我心意已决  为了彼此的未来
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Note,,0,0,0,,----------------- OP ----------------
